title: "Generative AI with Amazon Bedrock: An Online Textbook"
abstract: >-
  An open-source online textbook on Generative AI, Large Language Models, and
  building applications with Amazon Bedrock, adapted from the AWS Machine Learning
  University Generative AI curriculum. Aligned with the U.S. Department of Labor
  "Make America AI-Ready" AI literacy framework.
